The following requirements shall apply to any proposed subdivision, including proposals for
manufactured home parks and subdivisions, any portion of which lies within an area of special flood hazard:
1. The area of special flood hazard, including floodways and V-Zones, as appropriate, shall be delineated on tentative and
final subdivision plats;
2. Base flood elevations shall be shown on tentative and final subdivision plats;
